      "content": "it's hard to even talk about \"coping\" with it when the math just doesn't add up. it feels like i'm just delaying the inevitable. we're all just watching the end happen in slow motion, and honestly, it feels more like a burden than a life. i look at the future and see nothing but wreckage. it makes me wonder why anyone is still trying to pretend things are okay.",
